    "title": "Bedford County's Igloo in Everett gets national spotlight with surprise \"Jeopardy!\" clue - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WJAC Staff ,\n6 hours ago BEDFORD COUNTY, Pa. (WJAC) — A longtime roadside landmark in Bedford County is getting a boost of national attention after a surprise appearance on “Jeopardy!”. The Igloo in Everett, known for its distinctive shape and longtime presence along Route 30, was recently featured as part of a clue on the popular game show. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
